% Regression guard for the -BF option without a model number (issue #8).
% -BF alone selects stress model 2, but the default used to apply only when
% -BF was the last argument: followed by another option, Barfly mode was
% silently turned off.  The golden test passes a plain -BF, which the test
% runner follows with other options, so the golden must be the stressed
% rendering, the same as with -BF 2.
X:1
T:Barfly option order
C:abc2midi test
M:6/8
L:1/8
R:jig
K:G
BAG GAB|BAG GAB|dBG AFD|GBd g3|
